Notebook[{Cell["Generic unequal-charge horizon regularity", "Title"], 
  Cell["Version-3 human notation guide (documentation only; no Input cell is \
changed). In the compact solution and verifier notebooks: x=r^2; q1,q2,q3 are \
the harmonic parameters mu1,mu2,mu3, not normalized conserved charges; jrot \
is the rotation parameter j; U1,U2,U3 are the electric corrections delta u_I; \
B1,B2,B3 are the gauge-covariant fibre corrections; Om is delta omega; Ft, \
Gr, and Sq are the temporal warp, radial warp, and squashing corrections; P \
and S are delta p and delta s, where X1=exp(2p/3-s), X2=exp(2p/3+s), and \
X3=exp(-4p/3). Physical quantities are Q_I=Pi mu_I/(4 G5) and J1=J2=Pi j/(4 \
G5). See the report section 'Human-readable notation and result at a glance' \
for the full dictionary.", "Text"], 
  Cell["Exact in rotation at first order in lambda3", "Subtitle"], 
  Cell["This notebook is a standalone human-verification certificate for the \
corrected BMPV horizon. It embeds the complete exact-in-j solution and \
constructs the horizon-centering shift, ingoing co-rotating metric, scalar \
invariants, regular gauge-frame components, and gauge-invariant contractions. \
It reads no external file.", "Text"], Cell["Assumptions: q1,q2,q3 are \
positive and the strict BMPV gap q1 q2 q3-jrot^2 is positive. The result is \
perturbative in lambda3 and is not uniform at the zero-area bound.", "Text"], 
  Cell["1. Embedded exact solution", "Section"], 
  Cell[BoxData["ClearAll[\"Global`*\"]; $HistoryLength=0; \
$RecursionLimit=300000; $MaxExtraPrecision=10000;"], "Input"], 
  Cell[BoxData["solution=<|\"Gauge\" -> \"dhr=0; areal x=r^2; fixed Page \
charges; fixed physical J\", \"OrderInLambda3\" -> 1, \"RotationDependence\" \
-> \"exact finite polynomial through jrot^3\", \"U1\" -> \
(8*(-12*q1^3*q2^3*q3^2 + 2*q1^3*q2^3*q3*x - 28*q1^3*q2^2*q3^2*x - \
16*q1^2*q2^3*q3^2*x + 4*q1^3*q2^3*x^2 + 13*q1^3*q2^2*q3*x^2 + \
17*q1^2*q2^3*q3*x^2 - 27*q1^3*q2*q3^2*x^2 - 32*q1^2*q2^2*q3^2*x^2 - \
5*q1*q2^3*q3^2*x^2 + 12*q1^3*q2^2*x^3 + 12*q1^2*q2^3*x^3 + 8*q1^3*q2*q3*x^3 + \
62*q1^2*q2^2*q3*x^3 + 14*q1*q2^3*q3*x^3 - 10*q1^3*q3^2*x^3 - \
32*q1^2*q2*q3^2*x^3 - 8*q1*q2^2*q3^2*x^3 + 2*q2^3*q3^2*x^3 + 7*q1^3*q2*x^4 + \
34*q1^2*q2^2*x^4 + 7*q1*q2^3*x^4 - q1^3*q3*x^4 + 47*q1^2*q2*q3*x^4 + \
41*q1*q2^2*q3*x^4 + 5*q2^3*q3*x^4 - 13*q1^2*q3^2*x^4 - 12*q1*q2*q3^2*x^4 + \
5*q2^2*q3^2*x^4 + 22*q1^2*q2*x^5 + 16*q1*q2^2*x^5 + 2*q2^3*x^5 + \
8*q1^2*q3*x^5 + 24*q1*q2*q3*x^5 + 10*q2^2*q3*x^5 - 6*q1*q3^2*x^5 + \
2*q2*q3^2*x^5 + 3*q1^2*x^6 + 6*q1*q2*x^6 + 3*q2^2*x^6 + 3*q1*q3*x^6 + \
3*q2*q3*x^6))/(3*(q1 + x)^3*(q2 + x)^2*(q3 + x)^2*(q1*q2 + q1*q3 + q2*q3 + \
2*q1*x + 2*q2*x + 2*q3*x + 3*x^2)) - (16*jrot^2*(3*q1*q2*q3 + (4*q1*q2 + \
4*q1*q3 + q2*q3)*x + (5*q1 + 2*q2 + 2*q3)*x^2 + 3*x^3))/((q1 + x)^2*(q2 + \
x)*(q3 + x)^2*((q1 + x)*(q2 + x) + (q1 + x)*(q3 + x) + (q2 + x)*(q3 + x))), \
\"U2\" -> (8*(-12*q1^3*q2^3*q3^2 + 2*q1^3*q2^3*q3*x - 16*q1^3*q2^2*q3^2*x - \
28*q1^2*q2^3*q3^2*x + 4*q1^3*q2^3*x^2 + 17*q1^3*q2^2*q3*x^2 + \
